# Trivy ignore file for the SECURE stack (terraform/secure + fs scan).
#
# Only SPECIFIC misconfiguration IDs that cannot be addressed in this
# academic, low-cost scope are listed. Each entry has a justification and an
# approver in docs/correcciones.md. Do NOT add broad/global suppressions here.
#
# AVD-AWS-0054 / AWS-0054 : ALB uses plain HTTP. No domain + ACM certificate
#   available in the exercise. Compensating control: ALB is the sole ingress.
# AVD-AWS-0053 / AWS-0053 : ALB is internet-facing. Expected for a public demo.
# AVD-AWS-0104 / AWS-0104 : Egress 443 to 0.0.0.0/0 is required to reach AWS
#   APIs (ECR, SSM, KMS) through the NAT gateway. Restricted to port 443.
# AVD-AWS-0089 / AWS-0089 : S3 server access logging on the ALB-logs bucket
#   itself is not applicable (it already stores access logs).

AWS-0053
AWS-0054
AWS-0104
AWS-0089
